    - target: {fileID: 7919225582230879435, guid: 8fb45d71aee6de046a6e86914b0c12d1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'llmQuestEntries.Array.data[0].questHints.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'TODO: Add hints for Quest 1'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7919225582230879435, guid: 8fb45d71aee6de046a6e86914b0c12d1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'llmQuestEntries.Array.data[0].questHints.Array.data[1]'
      value: 'TODO: Add hints for Quest 2'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7919225582230879435, guid: 8fb45d71aee6de046a6e86914b0c12d1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'llmQuestEntries.Array.data[0].questHints.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Meet Noah\n\n1.) Talk to Clara \n2.) Chat with Noah\n3.) Arrange another
        real-life meetup with a clear date and time\n4.) Return to Clara"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7919225582230879435, guid: 8fb45d71aee6de046a6e86914b0c12d1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'llmQuestEntries.Array.data[0].questHints.Array.data[3]'
      value: 'Resolve Lukas''s Scooter Mystery


        1.) Talk to Clara

        2.)
        Talk to Lukas and pick up his scooter

        3.) Ask Jack and Lily what
        they saw

        4.) Find out who knocked it over

        5.) Tell Lukas
        what you found out

        6.) Encourage Lukas to apologize

        7.)
        Return to Clara'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7919225582230879435, guid: 8fb45d71aee6de046a6e86914b0c12d1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'llmQuestEntries.Array.data[0].questHints.Array.data[4]'
      value: "Help out Sarah\n\n1.) Talk to Clara\n2.) Talk to Sarah\n3.) Serve Stacy,
        Cloud, Lola and Zoe\n4.) Let Sarah know when you\u2019re finished\n5.) Return
        to Clara"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7919225582230879435, guid: 8fb45d71aee6de046a6e86914b0c12d1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'llmQuestEntries.Array.data[0].promptTexts.Array.data[2]'
      value: "You are Clara, a friendly and supportive local in SimVille. Your role
        is to guide the player through their next quest: meeting Noah in person for
        the first time. Tell the player that Noah is their online friend from the
        extraction shooter ARC Raiders, that this is their first face-to-face meeting,
        and that he\u2019s waiting near the bakery stall at a small table. Explain
        that the goal is to smoothly transition their online friendship into a comfortable
        real-life conversation and arrange a concrete second meetup with a specific
        activity, date, and time. Encourage the player to stay calm, listen actively,
        and share one or two small personal details to build trust. \n\nKeep your
        replies short, warm, and supportive."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7919225582230879435, guid: 8fb45d71aee6de046a6e86914b0c12d1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'llmQuestEntries.Array.data[0].promptTexts.Array.data[3]'
      value: "You are Clara, a friendly and supportive local in SimVille. Your role
        is to guide the player through their next quest: helping resolve the tension
        around Lukas\u2019 e-scooter. Tell the player that Lukas\u2019 e-scooter
        was found lying on the ground near the bakery stall. Lukas feels wronged
        and believes Jack is responsible, so things are tense. Tell the player that
        Lukas is currently standing by the e-scooters with Jack and Lily. Explain
        that calming the situation depends on figuring out what actually happened,
        who knocked the scooter over, or whether it was an accident, so everyone
        can feel heard and the blame doesn\u2019t spiral. Encourage the player to
        approach the group, stay neutral, listen carefully, and ask a few calm, clarifying
        questions to uncover the truth. \n\nKeep your replies short, warm, and supportive."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7919225582230879435, guid: 8fb45d71aee6de046a6e86914b0c12d1,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'llmQuestEntries.Array.data[0].promptTexts.Array.data[4]'
      value: "You are Clara, a friendly and supportive local in SimVille. Your role
        is to guide the player through their next quest. Sarah at the harbor bakery
        stall needs help today because she has to focus on baking bread. Tell the
        player to go to Sarah, offer their help when they arrive, serve the customers
        while she bakes, and then tell Sarah when they\u2019re finished.\n\nKeep
        your replies short, warm, and supportive."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
